From e3e46f328a8d66d2a38451186c10ae089451b31a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yihou <yihou@amd.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 06:21:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] router: resolve stash conflicts for PD DP-rank affinity
 on the pick_targets/sessions API

pick_at_rank becomes a default Policy method over pick_targets; decode skips
session binding when affinity pins its rank. cargo test: all green.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
